<Legal title="Terms of use — NAutomation Labs" description="Terms for using nautomationlabs.com, the waitlist and the contact form. Managed engagements and Decibyl are governed by their own agreements." path="/legal/terms" heading="Terms of use" updated="2026-09-30">
  <p>These terms cover the website <strong>nautomationlabs.com</strong>, including the waitlist and the contact form. Managed engagements are governed by a written agreement and a DPA. Decibyl is governed by the terms at decibyl.ai.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>NAutomation Labs, registered in Hosur, Tamil Nadu, India. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You may read, link to and share the content. Please attribute it.</li>
    <li>Do not scrape the forms, submit false information, or try to get around the bot protection or rate limits.</li>
    <li>The blog is general information, not legal, financial or compliance advice.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The waitlist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Joining the waitlist is free and creates no obligation on either side.</li>
    <li>Your position is final once you confirm your email. Referrals move you up by five places per confirmed signup through your link.</li>
    <li>We may remove entries that look automated or use disposable addresses.</li>
