  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>The site is provided as is. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for loss arising from use of the site or reliance on its content. Nothing here limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Courts in Tamil Nadu have jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We update the date at the top when these terms change.</p>
</Legal>
